  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-starry-stage-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "88cc873ea275e3a70209d5fb6d42b9b2d4a070c4d9c10c0187251a12fdf612e4",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d832392fc1f3d4eabbc2c4acf92c421bb12af853847a16b9db07f6290f772c5b",
      "text": "悟空的星星小剧场",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "12c2083cc1121d4a15eb6f39f3511d6587c2362a64fb3c2947adea5e6b5c5990",
      "text": "今晚有故事会！\n悟空搭了一个小舞台，\n后面挂着一块蓝色幕布。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "30b70dd2425c6378243713970c906e2213478000e56876ee9af31b24c492f723",
      "text": "悟空把纸星星贴到幕布上：\n一、二、三、四、五、六。\n舞台上亮着六颗星星。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f1af0ab2729c318a50cd26f4f5fba2e12707c1c955c2ae824c61f0d8d116249c",
      "text": "玉兔蹦蹦跳跳地来了，\n手里拿着两颗星星：\n“我可以把它们加上去吗？”\n悟空说：“好呀！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1db512696507abe33344df398266d46deda5cb28d5ab279b99a4e7db1b3e6803",
      "text": "玉兔又贴上两颗星星。\n六颗再加两颗，\n一共八颗！\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "43e426cd5d1d9f7fec75a191dfb8d2c8432fc260b3b7602770cc7696ce81f46a",
      "text": "八戒抱着故事书来了。\n他在入口停下来，\n那里只有一块光秃秃的小牌子。\n“故事会是在这里吗？”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eac7616d11fce4378fdac8d93523420bb52aef0c2387f7bdf4b98d550b003962",
      "text": "玉兔说：“入口也需要星星。”\n悟空说：“可是星星都用完了。”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5272a6ed5b502d02cf66e1d938122a7e7923dd7ea653e61e811ddc03b8091e8d",
      "text": "悟空想到一个办法：\n“我们从幕布上拿下三颗吧。”\n一、二、三，拿下来啦！\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "97f0cbff6084b357e2f7ffa0be8d3776aa85ade6280ccf793523e2aea65366c7",
      "text": "幕布上还剩几颗？\n一、二、三、四、五。\n拿走三颗，还剩五颗。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c428945c085e951cb350db7b271e6d0d8e9170bd4408a735c8435ebd121215e4",
      "text": "他们把三颗星星贴到小牌子上，\n入口也亮起来啦！\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "05644a9bb1f9a8c92dd1a0db72bb992a20243d692c58113f473da7daf7ea73a2",
      "text": "八戒有点担心：\n“我们是不是弄丢了三颗？”\n玉兔说：“没有呀，\n入口需要星星，\n我们只是给它们搬了个家。”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "698cbdad6afae9186d49c0523daba35f179a23597f6fcba9496b9419e76e6701",
      "text": "悟空把星星都数了一遍：\n幕布上还剩五颗，\n入口有三颗，\n“还是一共八颗！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "16eaa33fe218c6776021d11049fd8444693f5cfce90339a7996add906e3f92fc",
      "text": "八戒拍拍圆圆的肚子：\n“我的肚子能当月亮吗？”\n大家都笑了。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d6100e42cdb042d76608847f3303eae66cd9b233655e1865f00251130384d75a",
      "text": "悟空说：“月亮不是星星，\n所以还是八颗星星。”\n玉兔说：“还有一个肚子月亮！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7c2b53faa26d0cb7faff55ef6ed920c7b699d538f3380414e1b95ae8bd0a9795",
      "text": "舞台布置好了。\n玉兔和悟空坐到软垫上，\n八戒翻开故事书：\n“很久很久以前……”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dc255b56042fe28a2becb7389ce7e3c1ac74334a0d68ccb4c4691b7cffa695e4",
      "text": "故事讲完了，悟空抬头一看：\n天上亮起了真的星星。\n他小声说：“好多星星！”\n多得数也数不清！\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
