    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "69e7a11c411e262c3e36e568570bf3f227d8a5f01cd61e7b8147dd1c72788fe1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n六颗加两颗，一共八颗；\n拿走三颗，还剩五颗；\n合起来还是八颗！\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
